 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Lovely. Hosting reunions are great. Do you want it one day, or several afternoons done over the internet? Then think about whether you want it to feel like an afternoon at the park, or an actual weekend. How many rooms one room per family? Or is cooking one big dish between you worth an entire day? If you cooking for everyone, and Everybody gets a piece, even if someone else is doing the primary dish. Keep it one room per family, and everyone shares the bathrooms. Keep a calendar outside so people know who's using the kitchen. seated lunch and dinner can be shared, everyone goes back to their room.",
